        <p>COUNTY BOROUGH OF WARRINGTON.— The Finance end Rstate Committee Invite TRNIJIIRS for the Quarterly TSHANOY of the following premises : SHOP, Market-gate, recently in the occupation of Mr. T. J. I cc. SHOP, hn. 14, Buttermarket-street, recently in the occupa- tion of Mem.. N. B. Percival and CO. WARR BMISP, No. 15. Buttermarket-street, recently In the occupation of Meurer Parkinson and Son. Tenders, stating for what butane,i the premises are required. should he eneorsed "Tender for Shop." and delivered t the Town Hall not later than Sattrday, the 19th Instant, addressed to " he Chairman, Ftnance find Estate Committee. Town Hall, Warrington." J. LiroN WHITTLES, Town Clerk.</p>
