      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1908-12-12_WidnesExaminer_art0016" n="art0016">
        <head>WHAT THE PEOPLE SAY!</head>
        <p>WHAT THE PEOPLE SAY!</p>
        <p>Green's Christmas Show</p>
        <p>HEAR</p>
        <p>IS BETTER THAN EVER. CALL AND SEE FOR YOURSELVES. You save 25 per cent. by purchasing from him. EVERYTHING FOR SALE.</p>
        <p>18 KNUTSFORD ROAD,</p>
        <p>Also Corner of</p>
        <p>PARKER STREET &amp; SANK-EY-STREET, WARRINGTON.</p>
