        <p>Now every Trust wilt soon be bust, At least, the papers say so ! And those who wish to earn a crust Can only hope and pray so. But spite of all that may befall, In this, I think, I'm clever, Until I'm dust, I'll always trust Woods' Peppermint Care for ever.—Advt.</p>
